OL,3,GNEWSATransgender patients told surgery
OL,4,Awas cancelled while already in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome patients of Wales' only
OL,7,Ftransgender clinic discovered their
OL,8,Foperations were called off while they
OL,9,Fwere in hospital, a health board has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FLast week NHS officials announced all
OL,13,Fsurgery commissioned by the Welsh
OL,14,FGender Service was being "paused" over
OL,15,Fconcerns about the number of referrals,
OL,16,Fand whether they were all appropriate.
OL,18,FThe NHS committee responsible said the
OL,19,Fpause had been needed for "urgent
OL,20,Fclinical assurance work".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
