OL,3,GNEWSATransgender patients told surgery
OL,4,Awas cancelled while already in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FCardiff and Vale University Health
OL,7,FBoard, which hosts the clinic, said it
OL,8,Fwas "truly sorry" for the impact on
OL,9,Fpatients and families.
